WEBVTT

00:00.000 --> 00:04.340
They use gas, they use almost anything,

00:04.340 --> 00:05.780
but they don't like wind.

00:05.780 --> 00:08.920
But they sure as hell like selling the windmills.

00:08.920 --> 00:11.040
Europe, on the other hand, has a long way to go

00:11.040 --> 00:15.040
with many countries being on the brink of destruction

00:15.040 --> 00:17.080
because of the green energy agenda.

00:17.080 --> 00:19.440
And I give a lot of credit to Germany.

00:19.440 --> 00:21.760
Germany was being led down a very sick path.

